<title>CANADA: Algonquin Mercantile raises Durkin stake.</title>
<headline>Algonquin Mercantile raises Durkin stake.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algonquin Mercantile Corp said on Thursday that it has purchased 1.5 million common shares of Durkin Hayes Publishing Ltd.</p>
<p>The share purchase will increase Algonqun's stake to 5.13 million shares or about 26 percent.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
